WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.071 --> 00:00:14.411
and Mandy looked around.

2
00:00:15.672 --> 00:00:17.093
They were in the shipyard.

3
00:00:18.174 --> 00:00:20.875
A group of men were building a Viking ship.

4
00:00:22.116 --> 00:00:24.698
It wasn't as big as the Sleeping Dragon.

5
00:00:25.818 --> 00:00:28.540
Still, the construction was amazing.

6
00:00:30.548 --> 00:00:33.510
Strong men dragged planks of oak wood.

7
00:00:35.351 --> 00:00:38.372
Others carefully carved the wood to shape the frame.

8
00:00:38.392 --> 00:00:43.835
"I remember reading in school about Viking ships," said Vinnie.

9
00:00:43.855 --> 00:00:45.976
"What did you learn?"

10
00:00:46.637 --> 00:00:47.397
asked Mandy.

11
00:00:47.417 --> 00:00:52.060
"Vikings were the best shipbuilders and seamen of their time.

12
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:57.823
Their ships were so fast that nobody could catch them," said Vinnie.

13
00:00:57.843 --> 00:00:59.664
"I caught you!"

14
00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.902
Someone grabbed the children from behind.

15
00:01:03.943 --> 00:01:06.946
The children had not heard Gunnar sneaking up on them.

16
00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:11.970
"You scared us, Gunnar," cried Vinnie.

17
00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:15.853
"I thought you were my friends," he said.

18
00:01:15.873 --> 00:01:18.716
"Why did you steal from my master?"

19
00:01:18.736 --> 00:01:21.838
"We didn't," said Mandy.

20
00:01:22.859 --> 00:01:24.481
She explained what happened.

21
00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:28.104
"Oh!" said Gunnar.

22
00:01:29.252 --> 00:01:32.534
"The captain didn't mean to put his bear charm in that box."

23
00:01:33.655 --> 00:01:36.537
A silly mistake had caused all this trouble.

24
00:01:36.557 --> 00:01:39.499
"So, do you have the charm?"

25
00:01:40.099 --> 00:01:40.920
Gunnar asked.

26
00:01:42.041 --> 00:01:43.502
Mandy held it out to him.

27
00:01:43.522 --> 00:01:47.224
"We must return it," said Gunnar.

28
00:01:48.245 --> 00:01:52.287
Suddenly the sound of a horn rang loudly through the air.

29
00:01:52.928 --> 00:01:56.030
"The battle horn," Gunnar said excitedly.

30
00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:57.551
"What does that mean?"

31
00:01:58.171 --> 00:01:58.852
asked Vinnie.

32
00:01:59.848 --> 00:02:01.790
"It is calling the men to set sail."

33
00:02:03.011 --> 00:02:04.913
Gunnar ran toward the sound.

34
00:02:06.054 --> 00:02:07.655
Vinnie and Mandy followed.

35
00:02:08.456 --> 00:02:12.199
When they got to the harbor, the entire village was there.

36
00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:16.623
All the Viking warriors were hurrying to their ships.

37
00:02:19.145 --> 00:02:22.708
They wore leather helmets and carried wooden shields.

38
00:02:23.869 --> 00:02:26.632
The men swung their swords high in the air.

39
00:02:28.012 --> 00:02:29.793
The battle horn kept blaring.

40
00:02:31.074 --> 00:02:33.074
Old Dirk was watching the ships.

41
00:02:34.335 --> 00:02:35.215
"What's happening?"

42
00:02:35.795 --> 00:02:36.556
Gunnar asked.

43
00:02:36.576 --> 00:02:41.998
"New land needs to be conquered," Old Dirk explained.

44
00:02:42.018 --> 00:02:45.980
"All the ships will sail together to fight."

45
00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:49.761
The children searched for the Sleeping Dragon.

46
00:02:49.781 --> 00:02:53.003
"There it is!"

47
00:02:53.743 --> 00:02:54.623
Mandy shouted.

48
00:02:54.643 --> 00:02:57.485
"Vinnie, the photo!"

49
00:02:58.726 --> 00:03:00.407
Vinnie took the photo out.

50
00:03:01.268 --> 00:03:03.049
It was now glowing blue.

51
00:03:03.069 --> 00:03:05.811
"But what are these round plates?"

52
00:03:06.612 --> 00:03:07.473
Vinnie counted.

53
00:03:07.493 --> 00:03:10.575
"There are 16 in the picture."

54
00:03:10.595 --> 00:03:14.518
"Look! They're the Vikings' shields!"

55
00:03:15.339 --> 00:03:16.199
Mandy cried.

56
00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:22.004
On both sides of the Sleeping Dragon were round wooden shields.

57
00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:26.523
They marked the places where each Viking warrior sat.

58
00:03:26.543 --> 00:03:30.647
"But I count only 15," said Vinnie.

59
00:03:30.667 --> 00:03:34.730
"I must go," Gunnar said.

60
00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.693
"Do not worry about Skull-Crusher.

61
00:03:38.553 --> 00:03:39.854
I will give him the bear charm.

62
00:03:40.895 --> 00:03:41.876
Good-bye, my friends."

63
00:03:42.957 --> 00:03:45.519
He ran to the ship without looking back.

64
00:03:45.539 --> 00:03:50.844
"Gunnar is true to his name," Old Dirk said.

65
00:03:52.144 --> 00:03:53.685
"What does his name mean?"

66
00:03:54.326 --> 00:03:55.046
asked Mandy.

67
00:03:55.066 --> 00:03:57.088
"It means 'warrior.'"

68
00:03:58.188 --> 00:04:00.530
Vinnie and Mandy stared at the photo.

69
00:04:01.791 --> 00:04:04.373
The old man was next to a longship.

70
00:04:05.293 --> 00:04:07.555
They looked up at the Sleeping Dragon.

71
00:04:09.937 --> 00:04:13.419
Suddenly one more shield appeared on the ship.

72
00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.621
It was Gunnar's!

73
00:04:18.382 --> 00:04:21.208
Now they could see 16.

74
00:04:21.228 --> 00:04:23.470
The glow in the photo turned red.

75
00:04:24.571 --> 00:04:26.894
The children's eyes started to close.

76
00:04:28.555 --> 00:04:31.798
Then they were falling down the dark tunnel again.

77
00:04:36.243 --> 00:04:40.467
"Hey!" The children landed in the attic.

78
00:04:41.668 --> 00:04:45.732
It was still dark, but the sun was just about to rise.
